Package: SpatialData.data
Title: SpatialData datasets
Depends: R (>= 4.6.0)
Version: 0.99.10
Description: 
    A companion package to access scverse-curated example SpatialData stores.
    The datasets span spatial omics technologies such as Visium, Visium HD, 
    Xenium, MERFISH, MIBI-TOF, and imaging mass cytometry, and are distributed 
    as zipped Zarr stores through the Bioconductor bucket on the NSF Open 
    Storage Network (OSN) or the scverse spatialdata sandbox. Available 
    datasets and their metadata can be listed, and each dataset is downloaded 
    once, cached locally with 'BiocFileCache', and read into R as a 
    SpatialData object via 'spatialdataR' package.
